# The pricing API (joyhub-integration). VITE_SCALA_API_URL is the host this page
# calls; it falls back to VITE_API_URL where a single host answers both. The
# page needs one of them: with neither it cannot load the manager list and says
# so.
VITE_API_URL=
VITE_SCALA_API_URL=
# on = show the test routes and status panels on a production build;
# off = hide them in development.
VITE_TEST_ROUTES=
